// Made things: tools, lights, throwables. Every solid or powder material has
// a block item too (id "block:<material>"), made from materials.ron.
//
// stack: most in one slot · color: icon colour until items have sprites
// use:
//   Mine(back, power, tier, speed, reach, area): a pickaxe (back: false) or an axe
//     (back: true, the background: trees, walls); power damage a hit, speed
//     hits a second, up to tier hardness, within reach blocks (4 cells each).
//     area (a pickaxe's, cells): C switches it to a round bite this radius
//     out of the rock nearest you toward the cursor (it can't reach through
//     rock), at 3/4 of its power, a little less towards the rim; big enough
//     to dig straight down and fall down the shaft as you go.
//     Hardness: dirt 20, wood 25, sandstone 35, copper ore 50, stone 60,
//     amethyst 60, iron ore 65, brick 70, silver ore 75, slate 80, emerald 80,
//     gold ore 85, basalt 95, ruby 100, mithril ore 110, obsidian 120.
//     Pickaxe tiers climb with them: copper 70, iron 100, gold 115, mithril 150.
//   Throw(Bomb | Glowstick) · Torch: plant one on a block face
//   Focus(tier, element, spells): a wand (tier 1, one spell) or staff (tier
//     2, two: left and right button) casting its spells (spells.ron) at the
//     cursor; the element it favours (optional). Found in the world, it
//     rolls its spells instead, from its element's up to its tier.
// aura: (light, strength, sparks: an emitter as in runes.ron `look`, `count`
//   a second; casting: times as many while it's used): what it gives off
//   at its tip while held
// about: a line for its tooltip
//   Bow(bow): a bow (weapons.ron): hold the left button to draw, let go to
//     loose an arrow (one of your `arrow` items) at the cursor.
//   Melee(weapon): a weapon (weapons.ron): the left button swings it at the
//     cursor; hold it to swing through the combo. Its icon is its sprite.
//   Chest: place one (furniture, 12 × 10 cells, on the ground); right-click a chest to open it
//   Potion(heal, over, sickness): drink it (click, or H: the first healing
//     one carried): heal health back over `over` s (0: at once), then
//     `sickness` s when no healing potion works
//   Station(id): place a crafting station (crafting.ron); a pickaxe knocks it back
// gear: (slot: Held, stats: {..}): counts toward its holder's stats while
//   in the hand, and can be found rarer (gear.ron has the rest of the gear);
//   on_hit: a coating (coatings.ron) left on what it hits ("venom")
(
    items: [
        (id: "copper_pickaxe", name: "Copper pickaxe", color: (205, 127, 50), use: Mine(back: false, power: 35, tier: 70, speed: 6.0, reach: 6.0, area: 7.0)),
        (id: "iron_pickaxe",   name: "Iron pickaxe",   color: (176, 178, 190), use: Mine(back: false, power: 60, tier: 100, speed: 7.0, reach: 6.5, area: 7.5)),
        (id: "gold_pickaxe",   name: "Gold pickaxe",   color: (236, 196, 72), use: Mine(back: false, power: 75, tier: 115, speed: 7.5, reach: 7.0, area: 8.0)),
        (id: "mithril_pickaxe", name: "Mithril pickaxe", color: (110, 220, 228), use: Mine(back: false, power: 100, tier: 150, speed: 9.0, reach: 7.5, area: 9.0)),
        (id: "copper_axe",     name: "Copper axe",     color: (190, 110, 45), use: Mine(back: true, power: 30, tier: 60, speed: 5.0, reach: 6.0)),
        (id: "torch",          name: "Torch",          stack: 99, color: (255, 190, 90), use: Torch),
        (id: "bomb",           name: "Bomb",           stack: 30, color: (40, 40, 46), use: Throw(Bomb)),
        (id: "glowstick",      name: "Glow stick",     stack: 30, color: (90, 255, 150), use: Throw(Glowstick)),
        // Potions: click to drink (or H, the first healing one carried).
        // Healing comes back 10 a second: over = heal / 10.
        (id: "small_health_potion", name: "Small health potion", stack: 30, color: (230, 60, 80), use: Potion(heal: 40, over: 4, sickness: 30),
            about: "A small red flask."),
        // Foci (magic::spells): each holds its spells (a wand one, a staff
        // two: left and right button), of its tier or less (a wand 1, a staff
        // 2); its element is the one it favours (its stats: that element's
        // power). One found in the world rolls its spells from its element's
        // (any, with none). Its aura: the glow and sparks at its tip.
        (id: "oak_wand",       name: "Oak wand",       color: (150, 110, 70), use: Focus(tier: 1, spells: ["spark_bolt"]),
            gear: (slot: Held, stats: { SpellPower: 5, CastSpeed: 5 }),
            aura: (light: (220, 200, 255), strength: 0.4, sparks: (count: 4, life: (0.5, 1.0), colors: [(255, 255, 255), (200, 170, 255)], speed: 5, drag: 1, glow: true))),
        (id: "storm_wand",     name: "Storm wand",     color: (200, 220, 255), use: Focus(tier: 1, element: Storm, spells: ["shock_bolt"]),
